    {
      "name": "dsh-hfsy-studio",
      "title": {
        "en": "HFSY Image Studio",
        "zh": "HFSY 生图工作台"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A full-page studio plus model-facing tools for OpenAI-compatible image/video relays: the agent calls generate_image / generate_video straight through this config, with a settings page for call routing, model queues (with fallback), resolution presets, per-model pricing, favorites, a character library, a 4K upscale tool and a filterable gallery.",
        "zh": "在 DSH 里开一个带侧边导航的全屏工作台，并把生图/生视频注册成模型工具：模型直接调用本插件配置的队列与分辨率预设；设置页可控制自动调用开关、模型队列顺序、分辨率预设，另有收藏夹、角色库、4K 增强、画廊筛选与按模型标价。"
      },
